units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p s
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3008 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1 origin 0 0 0
region box block 0 66.016 0 66.016 0 213.048 units box
create_box 1 box
region target_initial block 0 66.016 0 66.016 66.016 198.048 units box
create_atoms 1 region target_initial
group target region target_initial
region projectile_region block 0 66.016 0 66.016 0 66.016 units box
create_atoms 1 region projectile_region
group projectile region projectile_region
mass 1 92.90638
pair_style eam/fs
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 0.001
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time temp pe ke etotal press pxx pyy pzz lx ly lz atoms
thermo_modify flush yes lost error
fix equilibration all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
reset_timestep 0
run 100000
velocity projectile set NULL NULL 20 sum yes units box
fix production all nve
reset_timestep 0
run 100000
